1
00:00:00,394 --> 00:00:02,124
(Sheldon:)You want to see it?

2
00:00:02,129 --> 00:00:03,399
(Amy:)Can't you just tell me?

3
00:00:03,397 --> 00:00:05,467
(Sheldon:)But I made a video.

4
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:09,970
(Sheldon(on video):)I'm Dr. Sheldon Cooper,

5
00:00:09,970 --> 00:00:13,040
(Sheldon(on video):)and I'd like to tell you
why I should be chosen to...

6
00:00:15,108 --> 00:00:17,378
(echoing):
go to Mars!

7
00:00:18,645 --> 00:00:20,115
(Sheldon(on video):)I'm exceedingly smart.

8
00:00:20,114 --> 00:00:22,384
(Sheldon(on video):)I graduated college at 14.

9
00:00:22,383 --> 00:00:24,113
(Sheldon(on video):)While my brother
was getting an STD

10
00:00:24,118 --> 00:00:26,348
(Sheldon(on video):)I was getting a PhD.

11
00:00:28,621 --> 00:00:32,091
(Sheldon(on video):)Penicillin can't take this away.

12
00:00:32,093 --> 00:00:35,863
(Sheldon(on video):)Being in close quarters,
cleanliness is important

13
00:00:35,863 --> 00:00:39,133
(Sheldon(on video):)and... my hygiene is impeccable.

14
00:00:39,133 --> 00:00:41,263
(Sheldon(on video):)In fact, animals don't trust me

15
00:00:41,268 --> 00:00:43,268
(Sheldon(on video):)because I smell like nothing.

16
00:00:43,270 --> 00:00:44,270
(Sheldon:)Yeah...

17
00:00:44,271 --> 00:00:45,141
(inhales)

18
00:00:45,139 --> 00:00:47,339
(Sheldon(on video):)Literally nothing.

19
00:00:50,310 --> 00:00:51,880
(Sheldon(on video):)During the seven-month
space flight,

20
00:00:51,879 --> 00:00:55,319
(Sheldon(on video):)I can keep up morale
with my wacky sense of humor.

21
00:00:57,550 --> 00:00:59,320
(Sheldon(on video):)Hey, Leonard...

